    "body": "Isn't it simply that we should spec the things that are implemented and will not be removed?\n\n@Hixie, is the only purpose of calling certain things obsolete to discourage web developers from using them?\n\nFWIW, the split hasn't been particularly useful to me as an implementor, it means that some interfaces are split over multiple sections and occasionally I fail to find what I'm looking for because it's in the obsolete section.\n",
