    "created_at": "2015-09-01T17:48:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-01T17:48:16Z",
    "body": "The obsolete section has stuff that used to be used by authors, but should now not be used by authors. I avoid the word \"deprecated\" because it doesn't work. Something is either in, or not in. If it's in, we should support it and people should use it. If people shouldn't use it, we should commit to that, and list it as obsolete.\n\nI generally tried to avoid speccing obsolete stuff in the earlier sections because that would lead authors to think it wasn't obsolete.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
