    "updated_at": "2015-09-02T13:47:51Z",
    "body": "Interoperability between validators is rather hypothetical at this point, but at any rate I don't mind having things in the spec that only serves this purpose. I don't think `framespacing` isn't such a case, is there another such case you have in mind?\n",
