    "body": "> I don't think `framespacing` isn't such a case, is there another such case you have in mind?\n\nNo, I have no other new particular cases in mind.\n\nBut as far as `framespacing`, arrived in the spec from https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27987 by way of #50. But if we don’t have agreement that it should in fact be included in that list, then maybe we should just revert https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/d55300c4a7d25e1c5fc0b350893e6cb5d8d91887 (the changeset it came in from).\n",
