    "updated_at": "2015-09-02T13:59:37Z",
    "body": "So just to be clear, the idea is that implementations do nothing with `framespacing` but that it's mentioned in the spec for the benefit of validators? That seems fine to me, but currently it looks like Gecko does _something_ with it, so hopefully they can remove it.\n",
